OL,3,GNEWSAWorld's fastest bird gives
OL,4,Asearchers the slip
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe search is on for an escaped
OL,7,Fcaptive-bred peregrine falcon that has
OL,8,Fbeen flying around Peterborough since
OL,9,Fbeing spooked by a wild bird of prey.
OL,11,FPip, a six-year-old male, was being
OL,12,Fexercised near Stanground in the city
OL,13,Fon Saturday afternoon, when a wild
OL,14,Fperegrine falcon spotted him and
OL,15,Fattacked.
OL,17,FPip's GPS tracker was ripped off in the
OL,18,Faltercation and he took flight.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
